 "world": {
  "text": "Independent creative work exploring World, the on-chain prediction market. The identity, product and positioning are theirs; my work builds on that foundation through a series of key visuals, films and social concepts created for X. The creative approach was to translate an almost unbounded product idea into something calm, precise and inevitable, designed to stand apart in a feed built for noise. Selected work was reposted by @world_xyz, with some pieces further developed following direct creative feedback from the team.",
